Better AC being one of the primary factors informing survival in the early
game - and while other people can pet-ID, it takes time, and you have to
have not lost the pet.

A priest can also use any blessed spellbooks they find immediately, and
can bless uncursed spellbooks price-IDed as useful. More generally priests
can immediately bless other useful items found. The not uncommon case of
finding a magic lamp at Izchak's when other classes have made no holy
water - not a problem for priests.
